  coreRule:'折线图考的是时间中的变化。Overview 先讲总体方向和最显著关系；细节段按趋势相似或相反分组，数字只为趋势提供证据。',
  questionSignals:['The line graph shows … from [year] to [year].','The graph compares changes in … over a period of …','Figures are given for / projected to …','The chart illustrates how … changed over time.'],
