  blueprint:[{part:'P1 · Introduction',words:'25–35',job:'说明表格对象、指标、时间及不同单位。'},{part:'P2 · Overview',words:'35–45',job:'写整体领先者、共同模式和差距最大的指标。'},{part:'P3 · Details 1',words:'50–60',job:'按对象比较高值组或第一组指标。'},{part:'P4 · Details 2',words:'50–60',job:'按指标覆盖其余对象，突出例外和相近值。'}],
  paragraphs:[
    {label:'PARAGRAPH 01',title:'开头段：准确概括行、列和时间',purpose:'说明比较对象与指标，必要时概括多种单位。',words:'25–35 words',formula:'Table ＋ Rows/groups ＋ Columns/indicators ＋ Time',steps:['识别行是对象还是指标。','把多个列标题概括为 performance indicators / demographic measures。','时间表格要写年份；静态表格不使用变化动词。'],sentenceFrames:['The table compares [groups] across [number] indicators.','The table provides data on [measures] in [places/years].','Information is given for [objects] in terms of [indicators].','Figures are presented in [units], depending on the measure.'],wordBank:['indicator 指标','measure 衡量项','in terms of 就…而言','provide data on 提供…数据','corresponding figure 对应数值','depending on 视…而定'],example:'The table compares four countries in terms of annual income, average life expectancy and daily calorie supply.',coachNote:'单位不同时，可以说 across three socioeconomic indicators，不必把美元、年和卡路里硬塞进一个长句。'},
    {label:'PARAGRAPH 02',title:'Overview：找到“多项领先者”和最强关联',purpose:'概括对象排名、共同模式、极端差距或唯一例外。',words:'35–45 words',formula:'Overall leader/laggard ＋ Cross-column pattern ＋ Exception/largest gap',steps:['横看每一行，找多项领先或垫底对象。','纵看每一列，判断排名是否相似。','找差距最大和最小的指标。','不写全部精确数字。'],sentenceFrames:['Overall, X led the table on most measures, while Y ranked last.','A broadly similar ranking can be seen across all three indicators.','The greatest variation occurred in …','This was the only measure on which X did not rank first.'],wordBank:['lead the table 领先','rank last 排名末位','across most measures 多数指标','variation 差异','correlation 关联','notable exception 显著例外'],example:'Overall, Canada ranked highest on all three indicators, whereas Zaire recorded the lowest figures. Income showed by far the greatest disparity, although the ranking for life expectancy and calorie supply broadly followed the same pattern.',coachNote:'Overview 的“故事”常来自列与列之间的关系，例如收入高的国家寿命也更长，而不是某个孤立数字。'},
    {label:'PARAGRAPH 03',title:'细节段一：从领先对象出发建立跨指标比较',purpose:'用少量数据证明高值组的排名和关联。',words:'50–60 words',formula:'Leading object(s) → Key values → Cross-indicator relation → Comparison',steps:['选择最能代表总体模式的两行或两列。','一句覆盖同一对象的多个相关指标。','使用 corresponding / respectively 减少重复。','不同单位只能比较排名，不能说某数字大于另一指标。'],sentenceFrames:['X recorded the highest income, at …, and also had …','The corresponding figures for Y were …','A similar ranking is evident for …','Although A exceeded B in [measure], the reverse was true for …'],wordBank:['corresponding 对应的','respectively 分别','a similar ranking 相似排名','exceed 超过','by a substantial margin 大幅领先','be associated with 与…相关'],example:'Canada reported the highest annual income, at $11,100, together with life expectancy of 76 years and the largest calorie supply. Japan followed a similar pattern for health and nutrition despite a lower income, with corresponding figures that still exceeded those of the two developing countries.',coachNote:'不要把“相关”写成“导致”。表格只能显示 association，除非题目明确提供因果信息。'},
    {label:'PARAGRAPH 04',title:'细节段二：覆盖低值组、例外和最小差距',purpose:'完成其余数据，并指出与总体模式不完全一致之处。',words:'50–60 words',formula:'Lower group → Values/range → Exception → Final contrast',steps:['合并低值或相近对象。','用 range from … to … 压缩一列。','若有例外，明确指出它在哪个指标打破排名。','以最大差距或相近项收尾。'],sentenceFrames:['At the other end of the table, …','Figures for A and B were much lower, at … and …','Values ranged from … in X to … in Y.','This was the only indicator for which the usual ranking was reversed.'],wordBank:['at the other end 另一端','lag behind 落后','range from … to … 范围为','the usual ranking 常规排名','reverse 反转','little variation 差异很小'],example:'At the other end of the table, Peru and Zaire had dramatically lower incomes and shorter life expectancy. Zaire ranked last at 47 years and also supplied the fewest calories, while Peru performed moderately better on both measures. The gap between these countries was nevertheless far narrower for health than for income.',coachNote:'细节段不要求覆盖每个格子；目标是让关键模式有足够数据证据。'},
  ],
  languageZones:[{title:'排名',note:'跨指标概括表现。',items:['lead the table in terms of …','rank first / last','perform best on most measures','lag behind the remaining countries']},{title:'对应数据',note:'减少重复。',items:['the corresponding figure for …','respectively','a similar ranking is evident','values for the same indicator']},{title:'差距与范围',note:'突出列内变化。',items:['show substantial variation','range from … to …','differ by only …','by far the widest gap']},{title:'例外与关系',note:'讲表格故事。',items:['the only measure on which …','follow the same broad pattern','show a positive association','the ranking was reversed for …']}],
  scoreFocus:task1ScoreFocus,
  pitfalls:['尝试覆盖每个单元格。','不同单位的列直接比较大小。','把相关关系写成因果。','没有 Overview，只在细节中堆数字。','行列交叉看错，数字归错对象。','只横向写对象，没有纵向比较指标模式。'],
  checklist:['开头是否概括了行、列和时间？','Overview 是否写整体领先者与主要模式？','细节段是否只选择关键单元格？','不同单位是否避免直接大小比较？','是否同时包含横向与纵向观察？','行列、单位和 respectively 顺序是否核对？'],
  drills:['用 30 秒横扫一遍、纵扫一遍，各写一个发现。','把 20 个单元格缩成 6 个关键数据。','找出表中唯一打破整体排名的指标。','练习用 corresponding / respectively 合并句子。'],
